flowchart LR
  subgraph NOW[Current local synthetic prototype]
    UI[React + TypeScript UI<br/>Vite] -->|HTTP JSON| API[FastAPI process]
    SIM[Synthetic event simulator] --> API
    API --> ING[Ingestion + deterministic rules]
    ING -->|institution-scoped writes| LOCAL[(SQLite local ledgers<br/>same host/process)]
    ING -->|allow-listed signals| CORR[(SQLite correlation.db)]
    CORR --> DET[Rolling-window + graph rules]
    DET --> GRAPH[NetworkX observed-flow graph]
    DET --> CASE[Investigation cases + evidence]
    CASE --> REPORT[Structured report<br/>optional configured LLM]
    CASE --> INTERV[Simulated intervention]
    INTERV --> AUDIT[(SQLite audit history)]
    CASE --> AUDIT
    LOCAL -. investigator-authorized<br/>projected evidence .-> CASE
    API --> DB[(SQLite cases/settings)]
    CASE --> DB
    EVAL[Fixed-seed synthetic fixtures<br/>ground truth held by evaluator] -->|evaluate after detection| METRICS[Benchmark JSON]
    METRICS --> UI
    DET -. no labels .- EVAL
    CORR -. optional .-> KAFKA[Redpanda / Kafka topic]
    KAFKA --> FLINK[Flink fan-out detector]
    FLINK --> KAFKA2[Alert topic]
    KAFKA2 -. optional consumer .-> API
    ING -. optional mirror .-> AGE[(PostgreSQL + AGE)]
    INTERV -. optional lifecycle .-> TEMP[Temporal]
  end

  subgraph TARGET[Proposed enterprise deployment on LinuxONE / IBM Z Linux]
    BANKS[Fictional participating institutions] --> LOCALPROC[Institution-local transaction systems]
    LOCALPROC --> GATEWAY[Local disclosure policy gateway]
    GATEWAY -->|explicitly permitted signals<br/>authenticated encrypted transport| BUS[Managed event transport]
    BUS --> CORRSVC[Separately operated correlation service]
    CORRSVC --> RULES[Streaming + deterministic detection]
    RULES --> TGRAPH[Persistent transaction graph]
    RULES --> INVEST[Investigation service<br/>evidence requests to institution]
    INVEST --> HUM[Authorized investigator review]
    HUM --> ADAPTER[Institution-approved response adapter]
    ADAPTER --> SIMRESP[Audited simulated response<br/>until real authority/integration exists]
    GATEWAY --> TAUDIT[(Protected disclosure audit)]
    INVEST --> TAUDIT
    SIMRESP --> TAUDIT
    RULES --> EVAL2[Isolated synthetic evaluation]
    SUBSTRATE[Linux on s390x: identity, secrets, TLS, storage,<br/>monitoring, backup, failover, operational controls] --- CORRSVC
    SUBSTRATE --- BUS
  end

  NOW -. not a deployment diagram .-> TARGET
